{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40324","headline":"谢杨尚书惠樱桃 · 卢延让","name":"谢杨尚书惠樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满合虚红怕动摇，尚书知重赐樱桃。\n揉蓝尚带新鲜叶，泼血犹残旧折条。\n万颗真珠轻触破，一团甘露软含消。\n春来老病尤珍荷，并食中肠似火烧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}